      "content": "wait what do u mean too young?? i'm 34 lol. and is it really that bad for my kidneys? i just feel like i need something now before it gets worse. i dont have insurance right now so the clinic is gonna be like $200 just for a quick check. if i just stick to a normal dose of the macrobid like everyone says, is it really gonna hurt me that much?",
